      },
      "text": {
        "arText": "إِنَّا أَنزَلْنَاهُ فِي لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ",
        "enText": "Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree.",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Innaa anzalnaahu fee lailatil qadr",
        "bnText": "আমি একে নাযিল করেছি শবে-কদরে।",
        "bntextLatin": "Ami eke nayila karechi sabe-kadare."
      },
