      "text": {
        "arText": "وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ الْقَدْرِ",
        "enText": "And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Wa maa adraaka ma lailatul qadr",
        "bnText": "শবে-কদর সমন্ধে আপনি কি জানেন",
        "bntextLatin": "Sabe-kadara samandhe apani ki janena"
      },
