      },
      "text": {
        "arText": "لَيْلَةُ الْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ",
        "enText": "The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Lailatul qadri khairum min alfee shahr",
        "bnText": "শবে-কদর হল এক হাজার মাস অপেক্ষা শ্রেষ্ঠ।",
        "bntextLatin": "sabe-kadara hala eka hajara masa apeksa srestha."
      },
